{"name": "RollCats", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091700/extras/86277b361940c1371fe7b8f08042d243.avif?t=1772489571\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Race high-speed\u00a0robotic Cats on massive wheels across alien planets. Drift, shoot and boost your way to victory!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MODES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CAMPAIGN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the RollCats universe, collect <strong><i>Race Points</i></strong>, <strong><i>Crystals</i></strong> and <strong><i>Medals</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here You will unlock new <strong><i>Cats</i></strong> and <strong><i>Planets</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091700/extras/b45312b40d5a23aaf6d7b727d6763522.avif?t=1772489571\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CATFIGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your friends in local <i><strong>split-screen</strong></i> races. Go head-to-head in 1v1 duels or with AI Cats joining the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for gaming parties and family fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091700/extras/93ab254fc767241219569cf50b7dfc0b.avif?t=1772489571\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HANGAR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tune up your Cats with <strong><i>Crystals</i></strong> collected across the planets and upgrade their core skills.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Drift</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Speed</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Acceleration</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Turbo</i></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091700/extras/47da6ae119f739093e3ddcdda149d7c1.avif?t=1772489571\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RACE TYPES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into four different race modes, each with its own twist on high-speed robotic Cat racing.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RollCats Race</strong> \u2013 Classic 3-lap arcade races with weapons and boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Caterminator</strong> \u2013 Survival race where the last Cat is eliminated every lap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speed Lap</strong> \u2013 Pure speed runs: no combat, just racing against the clock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mous\u00eb Catch</strong> \u2013 Chase the Mice in this fast-paced special mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091700/extras/2658ade5a0feb9b07a1e4189d531f2ff.avif?t=1772489571\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Race high-speed\u00a0robotic Cats on massive wheels across alien planets. Drift, shoot and boost your way to victory!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/